POST /workspace validates receiver, reuses or creates a rooted ordinary ObjectWorkspace keyed by receiver identity, evaluates quoted Smalltalk source, and returns a typed value plus captured text or error. Each receiver has independent persistent scratch state.

Use evalInternal: for the outer expression so object workspace infrastructure does not overwrite the main last result.

The coordinator can supply a participant workspace as the parent. Keep the existing __inspectorWorkspace_<hex receiver ID> key shape, giving every participant independent receiver scratch bindings.
